FerrionOS change to base (MIT license, kept), made against upstream commit 20f7573b4dc011ea5267189185edc0b2f12bab0f with ferrion-boot-splash.patch, ferrion-lockdown.patch, ferrion-pty-hangup.patch, ferrion-live-disk-view.patch and ferrion-sigchld.patch applied:
- Mix CPU, firmware and timing inputs into the random generator; report seed sources through a read-only status file and accept root hardware-generator writes.
- Give randd the hardware right to read and wipe the reserved firmware seed page before entering the null namespace.

